OL,3,GNEWSA'Brave' boy, 7, called 999 when
OL,4,Adad had seizure
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have paid tribute to the
OL,7,F"exceptional bravery" and "great
OL,8,Finitiative" of a seven-year-old boy who
OL,9,Fcalled 999 after his dad suffered a
OL,10,Fseizure.
OL,12,FEli, from Swindon, ran outside to call
OL,13,Ffor help but, when he could not get a
OL,14,Freply from neighbours, dialled 999 and
OL,15,Fworked out his address with the help of
OL,16,Fpolice call handlers during the
OL,17,Fincident on 12 June.
OL,19,FHe also followed instructions to move
OL,20,Fhis dad onto his back before paramedics
OL,21,Farrived to take him to hospital, where
OL,22,Fhe made a full recovery.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
