OL,3,GNEWSA'Brave' boy, 7, called 999 when
OL,4,Adad had seizure
OL,5,
OL,6,FEli, who said he wants to become a
OL,7,Fpolice officer when he grows up, was
OL,8,Fgiven a Wiltshire Police award for his
OL,9,Factions on a visit to Gablecross Police
OL,10,FStation.
